# Build output (Cargo.lock IS committed - this is a binary crate, not a library)
/target

# Editor/IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# rustfmt backup files (created with `cargo fmt --backup`, harmless to ignore)
**/*.rs.bk

# Local env overrides, if any get added later
.env
.env.local

# Bundled ML model weights (see model_assets.rs/vocals.rs), the ONNX
# Runtime shared library (see onnxrt.rs), and the custom ffmpeg + openh264
# build (see ffmpeg_path.rs) - fetched/built by the release workflow just
# before packaging, not committed (large binaries with their own upstream
# licensing, not source code).
/assets/models/
/assets/onnxruntime/
/assets/ffmpeg/

# Likely-accidental exports if you run/test from the repo root
/*.cdg
/*.mp4
# Project files (.abyzl) saved while testing from the repo root - the real
# crash-recovery autosave lives in the OS per-user data directory (see
# project::autosave_path), not here, but a "Save Project"/"Save Project
# As…" during local testing can easily default into the working directory.
/*.abyzl
